                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17928282" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Wed, 19 Feb 2025 06:43:51 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The `gluten.jar` under `spark/jars` contains shaded modified third-party classes that conflict with the native classes in Spark. &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
Previously, the Gluten team temporarily bypassed the class conflict issue, but during the build process, a new Spark application is launched, and the class loading order may not proceed as expected, causing conflicts. &#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;DevDesign&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Dev Design&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Since Gluten is not required during the build process, the `gluten.jar` can be removed from `spark/jars`. &#160;&lt;br/&gt;
Meanwhile, the `gluten.jar` used by Kylin Sparder is expected to prioritize loading from `lib/ext/gluten.jar`, so there is no conflict between the two.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="17929001" author="githubbot" created="Fri, 21 Feb 2025 03:15:52 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;gleonSun opened a new pull request, #2265:&lt;br/&gt;
URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/kylin/pull/2265&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/kylin/pull/2265&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;upgrade avro and protobuf-java version to fix Security Vulnerabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


</comment>
                            <comment id="17929010" author="githubbot" created="Fri, 21 Feb 2025 03:31:47 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;jlfsdtc merged PR #2265:&lt;br/&gt;
URL: &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/kylin/pull/2265&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/kylin/pull/2265&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

</comment>
                            <comment id="17929011" author="jira-bot" created="Fri, 21 Feb 2025 03:31:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Commit e7a8207d61cdfd12033db74ffaca08789533bbc0 in kylin&apos;s branch refs/heads/kylin5 from Zhimin Wu&lt;br/&gt;
[ &lt;a href=&quot;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=kylin.git;h=e7a8207d61&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://gitbox.apache.org/repos/asf?p=kylin.git;h=e7a8207d61&lt;/a&gt; ]&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6016&quot; title=&quot;Kylin5 occasionally encounters ParquetFileFormat class conflicts during builds&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;KYLIN-6016&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;KYLIN-6016&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; fix driver &amp;amp; executor load same class from different classpath randomly when executing building job&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;upgrade avro and protobuf-java version to fix Security Vulnerabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


